   <cac:ProcurementProject>
      <cbc:ID schemeName="InternalID">F4E-OMF-1755</cbc:ID>
      <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Instrumentation and Control systems development and integration services</cbc:Name>
      <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">This procedure concerns the Provision of Instrumentation and Control services to F4E for I&amp;C systems design, development and integration. These services include the execution of activities necessary for the design and development of Instrumentation and Control systems, ranging from the implementation of the interface between industrial systems and ITER central control system infrastructure, to the design and development of complete control system of a given plant.</cbc:Description>
      <cbc:ProcurementTypeCode listName="contract-nature">services</cbc:ProcurementTypeCode>
      <cbc:Note languageID="ENG">In accordance with point 11 of Annex I of the GFR, Fusion for Energy may use the negotiated procedure without prior publication of a Contract Notice in order to award new contract(s) consisting of a repetition of similar works or services to the Contractor(s) chosen as a result of the present call for tender, in which case the amount to be awarded under that procedure will not exceed 50% of the initial Framework Contract(s) ceiling. Such a right will be exercised by F4E in case/in the event that/should one of the following circumstances occur: 1) changes in ITER requirements, 2) changes/deviations within or in relation to related F4E activities/contracts, or 3) shifts in the criticality of the project activities requiring I&amp;C services.</cbc:Note>
      <cac:RequestedTenderTotal>
         <cbc:EstimatedOverallContractAmount currencyID="EUR">18000000</cbc:EstimatedOverallContractAmount>
      </cac:RequestedTenderTotal>
